---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Testimonials from "../components/Testimonials.astro";
import Cta from "../components/Cta.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<Base
  title="About us"
  description="Mark Your Data is a data & AI consultancy founded in 2021 by Mark Schep and backed by a network of senior specialists. Clients include bol.com, Heineken, Tikkie and Winparts."
  image="/assets/photos/webp/photo_11.webp"
>
  <Hero
    title="About us"
    tagline="A data & AI consultancy that proves value before scaling"
    photo="/assets/photos/webp/photo_13.webp"
  />

  <section>
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Our story</h2>
      <img class="editorial-photo editorial-photo--right" src="/assets/photos/webp/photo_9.webp" alt="Mark Schep in front of a building" loading="lazy" />
      <p>
        Mark Your Data was founded in 2021 by Mark Schep. What started as independent consulting has grown into a
        consultancy backed by a network of senior specialists.
      </p>
      <p>We focus on three areas:</p>
      <h3>Strategy</h3>
      <p>Figure out where data can drive the most value. We help you identify opportunities and turn them into a concrete plan.</p>
      <h3>Platforms</h3>
      <p>Build a modern data foundation on open-source tools, on the cloud you choose.</p>
      <h3>Solutions</h3>
      <p>Turn data into business impact. Analytics dashboards or AI applications, we build what you need.</p>

      <h2>Who does the work</h2>
      <p>
        Mark leads every engagement. Depending on the project, he works solo or brings in senior freelancers from his
        network. Each specialist has years of experience and is selected for the specific challenge at hand.
      </p>
      <img src="/assets/photos/webp/photo_39.webp" alt="Mark with colleagues in discussion" loading="lazy" />
      <p><strong>Our network covers:</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Data strategy:</strong> roadmaps, opportunity assessments, and aligning data initiatives with business goals.</li>
        <li><strong>Data engineering:</strong> pipelines, cloud infrastructure, and the technical foundation your team builds on.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics & dashboarding:</strong> turning raw data into clear insights your team can act on every day.</li>
        <li><strong>Data science & AI:</strong> predictive models, machine learning, and AI solutions that create measurable impact.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <img class="editorial-photo editorial-photo--left" src="/assets/photos/webp/photo_36.webp" alt="Mark Your Data door sign" loading="lazy" />
      <p>After years of delivering data & AI projects, we've learned what separates success from shelfware: proving value early.</p>
      <blockquote>"Make it work, make it better, make it scale."</blockquote>
      <p>
        This methodology guides every engagement. <strong>Make it work:</strong> get something running fast.
        <strong>Make it better:</strong> refine based on real feedback. <strong>Make it scale:</strong> roll out what's proven.
      </p>
      <p>
        We'd rather show you a working prototype in weeks than a strategy deck in months. Clients often adopt this
        approach for their own teams long after we're gone.
      </p>

      <h2 id="founder">Meet the founder</h2>
      <img class="editorial-photo editorial-photo--right" src="/assets/photos/webp/photo_11.webp" alt="Mark Schep, founder of Mark Your Data" loading="lazy" />
      <p>
        Mark Schep is founder and principal consultant at Mark Your Data, a data & AI consultancy for growing companies.
        He has delivered dozens of projects in data strategy, data engineering, and AI engineering at companies including
        bol.com, Heineken, Tikkie, and Winparts.
      </p>
      <p>
        His approach: make it work, make it better, make it scale. He'd rather show you a working proof of concept in weeks
        than a strategy deck in months.
      </p>
      <p>
        His current focus is <a href="/conversational-analytics">conversational analytics</a>: building systems that let
        business users explore their data through natural language, without writing a single line of SQL.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you're a business leader who sees the potential of data & AI but needs experienced hands to make it happen,
        <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.
      </p>
      <p><a href={site.linkedin} rel="noopener" target="_blank">Connect on LinkedIn</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section--gray" id="reviews">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>What clients say</h2>
      <Testimonials />
    </div>
  </section>

  <Cta
    heading="Let's talk about your data"
    text="Have a challenge in mind? We're happy to discuss how we can help."
    button="Get in touch"
    photo="/assets/photos/webp/photo_40.webp"
  />
</Base>
